      "eyebrow": "GET TO KNOW ME BETTER",
      "title": "About *me*",
      "text": "Hey, I'm Snowman, a Community Management and QA professional from France with experience across various Roblox games and Discord communities. I have 3+ years of experience in Management.\n\nI specialise in community operations, staff leadership, moderation, server management, and quality assurance. I've overseen Discord community operations while contributing to testing across multiple Roblox projects, helping teams maintain organised staff structures, address player concerns, and identify issues affecting the player experience.\n\n\nI value clear communication, fair enforcement, reliable teamwork, and thorough testing. I'm always looking for opportunities to take on greater responsibility and help communities and games improve.\n**==Open== to: Community Manager, (Any) Lead, Staff Manager, Moderation Lead, and QA Lead opportunities.**\n\nI'm most active on Discord, so feel free to reach out.",
